# Typeahead in callback mode: self-insert takes the keys already there; after
# a numeric argument the key that ends the typeahead waits for the next
# rl_callback_read_char (found while fuzzing).
tags: callback typeahead fuzz
--- script
callback "> " 1

=== plain-typeahead-then-command
keys: a85*\C-t<dump>\r

=== argument-typeahead-then-command
tags: numarg
keys: \M-1a85*\C-t<dump>\r

=== argument-typeahead-two-keys
tags: numarg
keys: \M-1ab\C-t<dump>\r

=== readline-argument-typeahead
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
\M-1a85*\C-t<dump>\r
